WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.144 --> 00:00:07.080
A long face needs the opposite strategy from a round one.

2
00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:12.528
First, keep the crown volume low to avoid emphasizing the vertical length.

3
00:00:12.864 --> 00:00:21.264
Instead, adding moderate volume near the ears balances the width, drawing the eye sideways so the face feels shorter and more balanced.

4
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:30.336
Also, instead of sweeping all the hair back, a side part that lightly covers the forehead helps shorten the vertical look of the face.

5
00:00:30.672 --> 00:00:37.944
A long face can look older than it is, so careful hairstyling can create a younger, more vibrant look.
